    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="#consultation">Book a node audit</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="#plans">View plans</a>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-strip" aria-label="GSVIEC positioning">
      <span>Engineer-to-Engineer</span>
      <span>IaC-first</span>
      <span>No free infra abuse</span>
      <span>Designed for sovereignty</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="terminal-card" aria-label="GSVIEC node deployment demo">
    <div class="terminal-bar">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      <strong>gsviec/node-automator</strong>
    </div>
    <pre><code data-typewriter>gsviec deploy node \
  --network solana \
  --profile bare-metal-ha \
  --region eu-central \
  --sla 99.9

PXE boot .............. ready
Firmware policy ....... locked
Docker runtime ........ active
Prometheus alerts ..... synced
Failover route ........ standby

Node status: HEALTHY</code></pre>
